    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>It's not just \"stress\" though. It's more like... I see how much they care about trivial stuff. Their little jobs, their little dramas. It feels so shallow. Like I've seen something they'll never understand, and because of that, I'm not even part of the same species anymore. It's like I'm tuned to a frequency that doesn't exist in this world. It's just tiring. Always being apart.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
