      "content": "journaling isn't really gonna change the fact that i don't belong here. it's like trying to write a manual on how to be a fish when you've already realized you're a bird. the gap is just too big. sometimes i think maybe the reason i feel so out of place is because i'm not supposed to be here anymore. like i've already finished my part and i'm just lingering.",
